WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.784
September twenty-nineteen.

00:00:01.784 --> 00:00:05.068
A Quebec court strikes down the one safeguard that mattered.

00:00:05.068 --> 00:00:06.920
The foreseeable death requirement.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.000
The federal government could have appealed.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.761
They didn't.

00:00:09.761 --> 00:00:13.386
Instead they used it as their excuse to blow the doors wide open.
